{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>M.O.L.E. is a simulator horror experience about madness, ritual, and the depths we choose to dig. </strong>  <br> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You are the Navigator aboard a deep-bore vessel, a colossal drilling machine sent to pierce<br>the earth and  find something long buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">But the crew is gone. The vessel is silent. And the Signal won\u2019t stop calling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Operate failing systems, solve diegetic puzzles, and unravel the mystery behind your missing <br>crew. Keep the vessel alive as you descend into impossible depths, and into the erosion <br>of your own sanity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Piece by piece, you will uncover the weight of your past\u2026 <br>and the horrifying realization that you might not be alone down there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064510/extras/acbbb20a9d0499738945455209d2898b.webp?t=1764678760\" width=616 height=52 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064510/extras/de18a6c9a8a1e2a309d4dfdba54eb14d.poster.avif?t=1764678760\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064510/extras/de18a6c9a8a1e2a309d4dfdba54eb14d.webm?t=1764678760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064510/extras/de18a6c9a8a1e2a309d4dfdba54eb14d.mp4?t=1764678760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0 Operate the drill\u2019s navigation systems, charting depth, speed and pressure as you guide a  <br>massive drilling machine deeper into the Earth. You will have to adapt to different  <br>conditions, balancing speed and stability as the machine forces its way underground, <br>capturing the weight  of being the drill\u2019s navigator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064510/extras/415c43e6377fdc1ec403d10d3e80ab34.webp?t=1764678760\" width=616 height=52 /></span><strong> </strong>     <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064510/extras/73032efefa79404a8aa51129dca55f42.poster.avif?t=1764678760\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064510/extras/73032efefa79404a8aa51129dca55f42.webm?t=1764678760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064510/extras/73032efefa79404a8aa51129dca55f42.mp4?t=1764678760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Manipulate the vessel\u2019s systems through tactile, diegetic interfaces; rotating dials, flicking  <br>switches, typing on keyboards, and tuning frequencies. The puzzles are grounded in the  <br>machinery itself, demanding hands-on interaction where gameplay and simulation merge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064510/extras/8fcffa6f078ead64695a6daf0eb78587.webp?t=1764678760\" width=616 height=52 /></span><strong> </strong>    <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064510/extras/ca0d619b852e2bb83a6d9a90722181e2.poster.avif?t=1764678760\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064510/extras/ca0d619b852e2bb83a6d9a90722181e2.webm?t=1764678760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064510/extras/ca0d619b852e2bb83a6d9a90722181e2.mp4?t=1764678760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Spiral into your own history as fragments of your memory surface with choices that refuse to  <br>stay buried. Memory and faith blur together as the Signal grows stronger.  But memory is not <br>your only company; something prowls the vessel\u2019s empty  halls. The creaks in the hull  reminds   <br>you that survival means more than keeping the machine  alive,  <br> it means outlasting  whatever is sharing your coffin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  <br>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully diegetic simulation</strong> \u2014 Interact directly with tactile machinery. No menus or abstractions. All information is conveyed through in-world instruments, displays, and environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Horror through claustrophobia\u00a0</strong>\u2014 Experience the suffocating spaces of a machine that has become your world. The only voices left may not be human.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic PSX-style visuals</strong> \u2014 A grainy, analog aesthetic inspired by 1980s industrial horror that fuses the rough,  lo-fi textures of classic PSX horror with the lighting and detail of modern rendering, creating a world that feels   both nostalgic and disturbingly alive.    <br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064510/extras/d3bdf5e5a95d7ede0be23ec15dca8a0e.avif?t=1764678760\" width=600 height=180 /></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4064510?t=1764678760","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064510/408678e4945c6c8c73fe2de32d4dd49e79655d94/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764678760","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064510/1d985b1b7b7ea2dac3f8c3cffda6eec2b32114f3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764678760","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064510/1d985b1b7b7ea2dac3f8c3cffda6eec2b32114f3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764678760","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>M.O.L.E. is a simulator horror experience about madness, ritual, and the depths we choose to dig. </strong>  <br> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You are the Navigator aboard a deep-bore vessel, a colossal drilling machine sent to pierce<br>the earth and  find something long buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">But the crew is gone. The vessel is silent. And the Signal won\u2019t stop calling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Operate failing systems, solve diegetic puzzles, and unravel the mystery behind your missing <br>crew. Keep the vessel alive as you descend into impossible depths, and into the erosion <br>of your own sanity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Piece by piece, you will uncover the weight of your past\u2026 <br>and the horrifying realization that you might not be alone down there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064510/extras/acbbb20a9d0499738945455209d2898b.webp?t=1764678760\" width=616 height=52 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064510/extras/de18a6c9a8a1e2a309d4dfdba54eb14d.poster.avif?t=1764678760\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064510/extras/de18a6c9a8a1e2a309d4dfdba54eb14d.webm?t=1764678760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064510/extras/de18a6c9a8a1e2a309d4dfdba54eb14d.mp4?t=1764678760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0 Operate the drill\u2019s navigation systems, charting depth, speed and pressure as you guide a  <br>massive drilling machine deeper into the Earth. You will have to adapt to different  <br>conditions, balancing speed and stability as the machine forces its way underground, <br>capturing the weight  of being the drill\u2019s navigator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.aka